id: pm-7rrqsk
title: "The mandatory command-wiring replication set is enforced only by a prose checklist, and the census shows partial application is the single largest recurring defect class in the record"
description: "One logical surface change must be hand-written at eight to twelve artifacts that no declaration connects. A recurrence census over all 2,007 terminal items finds 247 of them touched src/cli/main.ts alone and the top file set is exactly the documented replication list, so partially applied wiring is the largest measured defect family. No gate reads a diff and asks whether the set was satisfied."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: "area:ci","area:contracts",defect-recurrence,gate,measurement
created_at: "2026-08-07T11:30:40.131Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-07T16:35:56.628Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-07T16:35:56.126Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-07T16:35:56.126Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 420
acceptance_criteria: "Replication sets are declared as contract data, one per kind of surface change, each member carrying the rule that decides whether it was satisfied; A pre-merge check reads the changeset, and when any member of a set is touched it fails on unsatisfied members, naming each and the rule it failed; A deliberate partial change is expressible only as a recorded, queryable waiver naming the omitted member and the reason, never as silence; A negative-control fixture that omits one member fails the gate in CI, proving the gate can fail; The gate runs locally and in hosted CI from the same declaration, and divergence between the two sides fails rather than being discovered; The recurrence index publishes the join of per-file recurrence density and size-cap proximity, so the highest-value decomposition target is an output rather than a manual comparison"
goal: project management = context management
objective: A change that must touch a declared set of artifacts cannot merge having touched only some of them
value: "The largest measured recurring defect family becomes a pre-merge failure instead of a post-release discovery, and the checklist agents are asked to remember becomes a check the build performs"
why_now: "The recurrence census has just quantified the family for the first time, and the grammar freeze will lock a surface whose registration sites are still connected only by prose"
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
resolution: "Added a mandatory surface replication gate with four cross-layer sets, changed-set activation, member coverage, refusal parity, waiver schema, source-size telemetry, and release-pipeline registration."
expected_result: Changes to a replicated CLI/SDK/MCP contract cannot land as a partial slice without an explicit validated waiver and ownership record.
actual_result: "The new gate and nine-test real-worktree matrix pass; quality:static and release readiness enforce it with four active sets and zero waivers."
